# Deny everything, then name the build inputs. The alternative (listing what
# to exclude) silently ships whatever gets added later, and this repo has a
# saves/ directory in it.
*

!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/

# Nothing under the two source trees is a build input except Go code, and the
# UI's embedded assets.
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/
